  "behavior": "Bounded startup ownership of original management/review WorkSessions. Reuse accepted request/receipts and original runtime identity/deadline without another native session or model turn. Recheck original scope and stop before every missing action. Preserve unknown native facts and administrative terminal states. Recovery-only lifecycle remains active with new admission disabled.",
